{"comment": {"id": "9090a229-7c21-486e-98ed-9fbc11a6fe09", "body": "Rationale for scope decision:
While Hill Country's initial email summary tentatively suggested a $310 exchanger swap and thermocouple repair, the formal diagnostic write-up on bill B2026-211 explicitly advises against piecemeal repairs on this 12-year-old Ruud RS75 unit. The bill write-up notes visible corrosion on the burner assembly and tank base alongside the cracked heat exchanger, formally recommending a full unit replacement (~$1,850).

This recommendation was reinforced on 06/30 evening when Tanya reported a complete loss of hot water and water pooling across the kitchen floor. Moving forward with full unit replacement during Hill Country's Thursday morning install slot.", "author": {"id": "user_d6c1beb9cf67594dae2f5de4529674f1", "name": "Carlos Mendez", "displayName": "Carlos Mendez", "email": "carlos.mendez@starpm.com"}, "parentId": null, "createdAt": "2026-07-01T14:00:00.000000Z", "updatedAt": "2026-07-01T14:00:00.000000Z", "quotedText": null, "resolvedAt": null, "issueId": "OPS-231"}}

